            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संविधान — saṁvidhān — \"a constitution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संविधानाने प्रत्येक नागरिकाला समान हक्क दिले आहेत. saṁvidhānāne pratyek nāgarikālā samān hakka dile āhet. The constitution has given every citizen equal rights."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter; also राज्यघटना."
            }
          ]
        },
