          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संविधान (saṁvidhān) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit saṁvidhāna, \"arrangement, disposition\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
