              "text": "लागू करणे — lāgū karṇe — \"to enforce; to bring into force\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सरकारने नवा नियम लागू केला. sarkārne navā niyam lāgū kelā. The government brought a new rule into force."
            },
