              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लागू करणे (lāgū karṇe) joins लागू, \"in force, applying\", built on लागणे, \"to attach\", which is inherited from Sanskrit lagyati, \"adheres to\" (CDIAL 10895), to करणे."
